# Windows-only project — keep CRLF in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# The hook bridge is read by PowerShell 5.1, which requires a UTF-8 BOM to parse
# the Hebrew strings correctly (see hooks/README.md). The BOM lives in the blob and
# git preserves it; this line only pins the line endings.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.vsix binary
